WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.992
Two accounts. Same 10% average a year.

2
00:00:02.992 --> 00:00:05.665
Different money at the end.

3
00:00:05.965 --> 00:00:08.658
Calm swings about 5% a year around

4
00:00:08.658 --> 00:00:10.177
its average.

5
00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:12.400
Bumpy has the same average,

6
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.458
with swings six times as large.

7
00:00:15.758 --> 00:00:16.912
At its worst,

8
00:00:16.912 --> 00:00:19.969
Bumpy was 43% below its high.

9
00:00:20.269 --> 00:00:21.423
Ten years later,

10
00:00:21.423 --> 00:00:22.577
Calm has $267.

11
00:00:22.577 --> 00:00:24.481
Bumpy has $173.

12
00:00:24.781 --> 00:00:26.704
Calm grew 10.3% a year,

13
00:00:26.704 --> 00:00:31.546
Bumpy 5.6%. Big swings drag on growth.
